WEBVTT

00:00:53.690 --> 00:00:54.830
What happened here?

00:00:57.150 --> 00:01:00.240
Takane-sama, this is just a diversion...

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:03.120
Their real target is...

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:05.510
Saku... -sama...

00:01:07.640 --> 00:01:08.920
Sakura!

00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:16.780
Flying through space, freely, gracefully

00:01:16.180 --> 00:01:20.480
On the shoulders and in the heart, the girl has wings

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:24.170
The world she was born into is beautiful

00:01:23.570 --> 00:01:27.820
Even a goddess cannot rule

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:35.230
That dream on a star born in darkness,

00:01:34.630 --> 00:01:38.130
it won't shine by just watching.

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:42.590
My body becomes a spaceship,

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:45.850
and climbs to the atmosphere of my thoughts

00:01:45.720 --> 00:02:00.610
If I try to resign to calmness, my heart will bug up.

00:02:00.270 --> 00:02:04.330
Hey, with your rocket,

00:02:03.940 --> 00:02:07.770
can you change my path?

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:11.700
By being connected together, we confirm

00:02:11.340 --> 00:02:17.240
we aren't androids

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:21.190
Across the rainbow, to the future to someone

00:02:20.800 --> 00:02:24.910
If wishing will get me there, I will gradually start believing

00:02:24.490 --> 00:02:28.570
The world we march into is limitless

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:32.240
Even God cannot destroy it all

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:37.380
And one day even the sins people made will disappear

00:02:40.740 --> 00:02:43.350
The basic system has no serious problems,

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:46.040
Steel Maiden

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:46.500
the voltage regulator is lacking,

00:02:46.500 --> 00:02:50.050
the main accelerator is lacking...

00:02:50.050 --> 00:02:54.020
The improvements on the Heat Management Bioterra Stabilization Bridge are also lacking.

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:58.400
Leopard's rate of full realization has reached 21%.

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:00.060
I'm still far away.

00:03:00.060 --> 00:03:04.210
This is all because withered leaf didn't collect all the components fast enough.

00:03:04.210 --> 00:03:09.040
What does she think is more important - looking for my missing parts, or her classes?!

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:11.660
Next up is the Golden Orb Warmer.

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:13.320
Ooh~ That!

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:15.260
I just can't wait for it.

00:03:15.260 --> 00:03:17.640
When all the scattered components are recollected,

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:22.850
I will no longer be who I am now, I'll be even more powerful than I am now!

00:03:27.070 --> 00:03:29.260
So, where is it?

00:03:29.260 --> 00:03:30.050
The Moon.

00:03:30.050 --> 00:03:32.880
Then, go call for withered leaf...

00:03:32.880 --> 00:03:34.130
You idiotic Leopard!

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:40.630
You bitch! How many times have I said I'm a very delicate machine!?

00:03:40.630 --> 00:03:43.010
Just what do you think you've done?!

00:03:43.010 --> 00:03:43.640
What?

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:46.940
Stripping people down naked. Why are you feigning ignorance?

00:03:51.240 --> 00:03:54.500
I now have very embarrassing memories all because of you.

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.640
Oh, that incident.

00:03:56.640 --> 00:04:00.030
How much are you saying your naked body is worth?

00:04:00.030 --> 00:04:01.860
There's a limit to being confident in yourself!

00:04:01.860 --> 00:04:02.540
What?!

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:04.480
If you're talking about true value,

00:04:04.480 --> 00:04:06.920
my body, which is like a polished jade-

00:04:06.920 --> 00:04:09.290
Ouch!

00:04:09.290 --> 00:04:10.180
You bitch!

00:04:10.180 --> 00:04:13.060
How could you possibly know the value of my naked body!

00:04:13.460 --> 00:04:16.480
You've never even seen a real body nude before.

00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:19.940
As a great artificial intelligence, what a naked human body-

00:04:19.940 --> 00:04:22.470
What great artificial intelligence?

00:04:22.710 --> 00:04:28.120
Aren't you just an inconsiderate piece of useless junk from an unknown world without common sense?

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:30.200
G-Get out!

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:32.080
I don't want to see your face again.

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:34.710
You are not allowed to step into the doors of this colony anymore!

00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:37.190
I would have done that even if you hadn't told me to.

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:50.740
There, the two of you, enjoy.

00:04:50.740 --> 00:04:54.140
Ooh... Isn't this from Galileo's office?

00:04:54.140 --> 00:04:55.710
I'm surprised you got your hands on this.

00:04:56.670 --> 00:04:59.680
Here, Kazane-chan, have one too.

00:04:59.680 --> 00:05:03.490
Please don't treat me like a child, Auntie.

00:05:03.770 --> 00:05:04.740
That's right...

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:08.240
Sorry for being late.

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:11.040
Sorry to trouble you so late in the night.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:12.190
It's an emergency right?

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:15.560
It's been a while, Uncle, Auntie.

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:16.050
Not at all.

00:05:16.050 --> 00:05:17.770
The same for us.

00:05:17.770 --> 00:05:21.170
Then, though we're not all present,

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:24.490
this is an emergency meeting for the Shishidou household.

00:05:25.160 --> 00:05:27.190
A situation has been developing...

00:05:27.190 --> 00:05:30.540
Now we'll have a report from Takane at the Moon.

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:35.000
It's been a while, everybody.

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:36.390
What happened?

00:05:37.060 --> 00:05:38.670
Sakura has been captured.

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:40.360
Sakura has...

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:44.900
We had received a report on the wanted Aleida, so the Shadow Corps went to restrain her,

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:44.900
Note: The Shadow Corps are covert guards for the Shishidou who protect the interests of the foundation without anyone knowing they're associated.

00:05:44.900 --> 00:05:47.430
but it seems that was only a diversion.

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:52.230
The Shadow Corps were ambushed and wiped out after they realized it was a trap.

00:05:52.230 --> 00:05:54.010
The Shadow Corps were wiped out?

00:05:54.010 --> 00:05:54.410
Affirmative.

00:05:55.110 --> 00:05:59.450
There is trace evidence that Shiou has been used by Aleida.

00:05:55.110 --> 00:05:59.450
Note: Shiou = Blooming Death

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:03.810
They say that whenever she appears, a large scale incident follows.

00:06:03.810 --> 00:06:06.480
The EX-QT woman, Aleida.

00:06:06.480 --> 00:06:09.150
Murder, vandalism, kidnap,

00:06:09.150 --> 00:06:11.890
there is no end to the list of crimes she's committed.

00:06:11.890 --> 00:06:16.160
Just as the serial abductions started happening on the Moon,

00:06:16.160 --> 00:06:18.810
she seems to have made an appearance.

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:20.690
As expected that woman is...

00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:24.150
We can only say that it's linked to Nerval.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:28.680
And that means that the Nervalists have resumed operations, right?

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:33.410
But what are they going to do with Sakura-chan?

00:06:34.440 --> 00:06:39.150
In any case, we need to make rescuing Sakura our top priority.

00:06:40.230 --> 00:06:44.570
We must not let those Nervalists take advantage of Sakura's genius.

00:06:45.050 --> 00:06:46.640
I'll go after Sakura.

00:06:46.640 --> 00:06:48.890
Moving without a clue is dangerous.

00:06:48.890 --> 00:06:50.310
I already have a lead.

00:06:50.660 --> 00:06:54.080
Be careful, this is obviously a trap.

00:06:54.080 --> 00:06:57.950
Don't worry, sis. That's what I'm here for, right?

00:07:02.240 --> 00:07:03.440
A new morning.

00:07:04.060 --> 00:07:06.940
From today onwards, I'm returning to my old life!

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:12.360
Ojou-sama, you didn't forget anything right?

00:07:12.360 --> 00:07:14.870
Nothing. Nothing at all!

00:07:27.310 --> 00:07:29.040
Did you know, Senpai?

00:07:29.040 --> 00:07:30.340
What's up, Neneko-chan?

00:07:30.340 --> 00:07:32.680
Some exhibitionists appeared yesterday.

00:07:33.750 --> 00:07:35.090
They were totally naked.

00:07:35.090 --> 00:07:38.300
They were streaking, butt naked!

00:07:38.300 --> 00:07:40.130
They stirred up quite a big fuss.

00:07:40.130 --> 00:07:42.340
I-I didn't know...

00:07:42.670 --> 00:07:46.500
Anyway, let's do something on the way home today!

00:07:46.500 --> 00:07:48.490
What's up, Senpai?

00:07:48.490 --> 00:07:51.350
For you to call us out, that's rare of you.

00:07:51.350 --> 00:07:52.510
I just felt like it.

00:07:52.510 --> 00:07:54.240
I'm going, I'm definitely going!

00:07:55.220 --> 00:07:57.740
Shishidou, did something happen?

00:07:57.740 --> 00:08:00.230
N-Nothing, why are you asking?

00:08:02.230 --> 00:08:04.330
No matter, no matter,

00:08:04.330 --> 00:08:07.130
no matter how you look at it, it's definitely the handsome Leopard.

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:09.950
No matter when, it's still the unique Leopard!

00:08:10.690 --> 00:08:12.240
Another "no matter..."

00:08:12.240 --> 00:08:17.640
Hmm... ah! My heart races whenever I see you~ Leopard!

00:08:23.990 --> 00:08:26.270
What are we going to "naturally" do next?

00:08:27.520 --> 00:08:31.720
About that, I don't know what I should do.

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:35.530
It's obvious that that colony and Shishidou are connected somehow.

00:08:35.530 --> 00:08:37.940
Find her and ask her upfront. It's so easy.

00:08:38.320 --> 00:08:42.580
But, it'd be rude if I interrupt them while they are talking.

00:08:42.580 --> 00:08:45.040
Why are you suddenly getting all shy?

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:47.960
Then, is what she's doing polite?

00:08:49.430 --> 00:08:51.950
The EX-QT Kawai Honoka.

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:53.380
We're tailing them.

00:08:57.410 --> 00:08:59.370
I thought you took the day off.

00:09:03.170 --> 00:09:04.960
The next component is on the Moon.

00:09:06.970 --> 00:09:08.280
No.

00:09:08.280 --> 00:09:08.940
Why?

00:09:08.940 --> 00:09:11.890
I don't want to see that guy's face again.

00:09:11.890 --> 00:09:13.820
There's no need to get so angry.

00:09:13.820 --> 00:09:16.090
Of course I'm angry!

00:09:16.090 --> 00:09:18.850
I wouldn't mind even if I were to be stripped naked.

00:09:18.850 --> 00:09:20.560
I mind that!

00:09:21.960 --> 00:09:24.770
Leopard is troubled when you're not around.

00:09:24.770 --> 00:09:26.940
Why is that guy...

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:29.360
Because Leopard has chosen you, Akiha.

00:09:31.970 --> 00:09:34.670
Why? Why is it me?

00:09:36.440 --> 00:09:38.910
Me... What do I have?

00:09:40.960 --> 00:09:42.430
Believe in fate.

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:46.960
Afternoon classes are starting.

00:09:58.620 --> 00:09:59.990
Nina?

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:04.900
Kannagi Itsuki's in Surre Academy?

00:10:04.900 --> 00:10:05.730
Yes!

00:10:05.730 --> 00:10:08.130
She became a ghost and came back to life!

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:09.990
There isn't any mistake.

00:10:10.470 --> 00:10:13.780
I've heard of the Paranormal Department conducting weird experiments.

00:10:13.780 --> 00:10:17.760
I think that Kannagi Itsuki was revived through voodoo magic.

00:10:17.760 --> 00:10:20.700
You're saying Kannagi Itsuki is still alive?

00:10:20.700 --> 00:10:22.430
We were tricked from the start then.

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:25.040
T-Tricked? Over what?

00:10:25.040 --> 00:10:26.670
That's what we should be asking you.

00:10:26.670 --> 00:10:28.330
Wait a minute.

00:10:28.330 --> 00:10:32.500
A routine officer like that couldn't have pulled this off.

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:34.470
There definitely must be someone pulling the strings.

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:38.820
It must be the department boss, Nina! Nina Stratoski!

00:10:38.820 --> 00:10:41.880
That person's black inside and out.

00:10:41.880 --> 00:10:43.450
What is she planning?

00:10:44.980 --> 00:10:47.680
It must have started with that colony incident from before.

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:51.010
That's when the Paranormal Department started doing things covertly.

00:10:51.540 --> 00:10:53.880
But then for the investigation, Kannagi must be...

00:10:54.540 --> 00:10:56.280
So she's in good health,

00:10:56.280 --> 00:10:59.560
and that means that the ICP's statement was fake.

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:02.240
We have no way of evading responsibility.

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:04.330
Before our mistake is taken advantage of by others...

00:11:06.190 --> 00:11:07.470
What are you two listening to?!

00:11:07.470 --> 00:11:08.540
Yes!

00:11:09.320 --> 00:11:11.170
We'll reorganize your mission.

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:13.810
Capture Kannagi Itsuki.

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:16.860
Roger!

00:11:17.230 --> 00:11:20.970
This is an important mission that concerns the survival of ICP.

00:11:20.970 --> 00:11:25.870
You must be cautious to prevent information from being leaked, especially to the Paranormal Department.

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:27.410
Roger!

00:11:30.060 --> 00:11:32.710
So that's how it is, Itsuki-kun.

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:36.890
Since your existence has been revealed, I can't act on your behalf anymore.

00:11:36.890 --> 00:11:40.600
I can only rely on you and Ul to work together and unravel this.

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:44.540
We don't have time to be standing around anymore.

00:11:49.830 --> 00:11:51.150
I'm home!

00:11:52.340 --> 00:11:54.980
Eh? You're the only one home, Nami?

00:11:54.980 --> 00:11:56.640
What? Is that bad?

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:00.280
Where's Kazane Onee-chan?

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:02.470
She'll be home late today.

00:12:02.470 --> 00:12:04.690
I see... What's that?

00:12:04.690 --> 00:12:07.340
Sakura sent it.

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:16.380
Yahoo! Sisters, how are you all doing? It's Sakura.

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:18.860
I sent you a new invention called the "Kuru Guru Zuu."

00:12:18.860 --> 00:12:20.170
New invention?

00:12:20.170 --> 00:12:23.470
It looks like a building recently erected in that new colony.

00:12:23.470 --> 00:12:24.590
That's lame.

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:27.320
She's still the same as ever, a child that's hard to understand.

00:12:27.320 --> 00:12:31.460
And then, you press that button once, and it will emit a "Kuru Guru" sound.

00:12:31.460 --> 00:12:33.180
Bye.

00:12:33.180 --> 00:12:36.520
So she sent it from the research lab again.

00:12:36.520 --> 00:12:38.610
Sakura is really busy, isn't she?

00:12:39.100 --> 00:12:42.100
You're really something, to understand what she says.

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:44.850
Everyone really is incredible...

00:12:47.190 --> 00:12:51.710
Hmm... Hmm... Leopard, with sentiments to a rice bowl.

00:12:53.320 --> 00:12:55.380
This won't do... I'm out of ideas.

00:12:56.550 --> 00:12:57.940
Just who I needed to see.

00:12:57.940 --> 00:12:59.740
Give me some ideas on how to praise myself.

00:13:00.010 --> 00:13:01.740
Why did you choose Akiha?

00:13:01.740 --> 00:13:02.900
What?

00:13:02.900 --> 00:13:04.660
She wants to know.

00:13:05.110 --> 00:13:09.290
I... I also didn't really want to choose her.

00:13:09.290 --> 00:13:11.420
If she were here, I wouldn't need withered leaf...

00:13:12.840 --> 00:13:14.630
That person is not here anymore.

00:13:23.730 --> 00:13:26.390
It's been such a long time since I last slept on a bed.

00:13:26.390 --> 00:13:28.730
It's really been some time.

00:13:33.410 --> 00:13:38.270
Having nothing to do... it was really this boring, wasn't it?

00:13:53.500 --> 00:14:00.180
I-I... I am the lodging house's mirror.

00:14:02.210 --> 00:14:05.180
I-I... I am history's most powerful boxer.

00:14:05.180 --> 00:14:06.600
What are you doing?

00:14:06.600 --> 00:14:09.030
Praising myself by using Shiritori.

00:14:09.030 --> 00:14:13.470
You praise yourself like this, searching for one's own good qualities.

00:14:13.470 --> 00:14:14.660
That's weird.

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:16.370
You should try it too, Akiha-chan.

00:14:18.440 --> 00:14:20.790
I don't have any good qualities.

00:14:20.790 --> 00:14:23.870
You have some, it's just that you haven't realized what they are.

00:14:29.150 --> 00:14:31.060
Shimoyama-san.

00:14:31.060 --> 00:14:32.500
It's Kannagi Itsuki.

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:35.810
Take me to that colony.

00:14:37.920 --> 00:14:40.010
Eh! What's going o...?!

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:54.120
Were you waiting for me?

00:14:55.360 --> 00:14:56.290
Aleida.

00:15:06.630 --> 00:15:09.620
The reception for today is over.

00:15:09.620 --> 00:15:10.410
That's what it says,

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:12.710
and we're in a hurry...

00:15:12.710 --> 00:15:15.910
They should have at least left the entry dock open.

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:17.580
Call the person in charge.

00:15:17.580 --> 00:15:19.350
That's impossible, Min-chan.

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:20.680
T-That...

00:15:21.670 --> 00:15:23.570
An outer floor route is open.

00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:25.720
It's the Paranormal Department ship, Min-chan.

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:29.800
T-This is a crime!

00:15:29.800 --> 00:15:31.240
Stop shouting, Lady.

00:15:31.240 --> 00:15:34.750
Mr. Policeman, please stop pointing that gun at Imo-chan.

00:15:34.750 --> 00:15:37.020
We aren't going to run.

00:15:37.020 --> 00:15:39.050
All right, I'll give you a break.

00:15:39.050 --> 00:15:40.750
You're cooperating with us, now?

00:15:43.290 --> 00:15:46.240
But I don't have anything to do with that guy anymore.

00:15:46.650 --> 00:15:50.950
When we meet Leopard, I have something I must ask him.

00:15:50.950 --> 00:15:52.370
Please enter the coordinates.

00:15:52.920 --> 00:15:54.900
About that...

00:15:54.900 --> 00:15:56.920
This is what I always do...

00:15:57.780 --> 00:15:59.050
I'm sorry.

00:15:59.050 --> 00:16:02.400
I didn't want to use such a forceful method but...

00:16:02.400 --> 00:16:04.540
This was the only way.

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:07.160
Why are you so interested in Leopard?

00:16:07.160 --> 00:16:10.640
Well... Asking an ICP officer is silly.

00:16:10.640 --> 00:16:13.600
No... It's not entirely because of work...

00:16:14.150 --> 00:16:15.520
That colony...

00:16:18.070 --> 00:16:21.650
It might have something to do with my missing parents.

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:22.960
Your parents?

00:16:23.330 --> 00:16:26.750
Yes. I understand if you hate me.

00:16:26.750 --> 00:16:28.800
This is for myself.

00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:32.620
I don't hate you or anything.

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:35.890
That's good, Kannagi-san.

00:16:36.400 --> 00:16:38.690
This is something that you have to do...

00:16:38.690 --> 00:16:41.890
A person with an aim... is definitely...

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:42.480
Yeah...

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:46.050
I don't have anything like that...

00:16:46.050 --> 00:16:49.610
Kazane onee-chan is the head of the Shishidou Financial Group.

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:54.620
Takane onee-chan is on Earth traveling about and learning different things.

00:16:54.620 --> 00:16:55.980
Even Nami...

00:16:55.980 --> 00:17:00.270
Even though she is on a break now, she is a very popular model.

00:17:00.270 --> 00:17:05.110
And my youngest sister, Sakura, is only twelve but is a professor.

00:17:05.110 --> 00:17:07.920
And is being scouted by many universities.

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:09.900
Even Imo-chan has her own dreams.

00:17:09.900 --> 00:17:10.800
Ojou-sama...

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:13.220
I'm the only one who has nothing.

00:17:13.850 --> 00:17:16.230
Erm... Can we go back to the main topic?

00:17:16.230 --> 00:17:17.160
Yes?

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:20.380
I hope you can tell me more about Leopard.

00:17:20.380 --> 00:17:22.100
Y-Yeah...

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:24.740
An order from the ICP to pull over.

00:17:24.740 --> 00:17:26.240
Damn. Is it the cops?

00:17:26.240 --> 00:17:27.550
Like I'm one to talk.

00:17:28.400 --> 00:17:30.230
It's a Grab Fisher like ours.

00:17:31.640 --> 00:17:33.700
We've found you, Kannagi!

00:17:33.700 --> 00:17:34.900
Be prepared!

00:17:35.910 --> 00:17:38.180
Bouminda, take off!

00:17:41.020 --> 00:17:42.730
Kannagi!

00:17:42.730 --> 00:17:43.920
These voices are...

00:17:44.730 --> 00:17:45.940
What?

00:17:46.570 --> 00:17:48.820
QT-Arms from Public Safety?

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:52.340
Kannagi Itsuki, this time we're definitely arresting you!

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:54.410
We are to arrest you on special orders!

00:17:55.720 --> 00:17:57.850
I'll stop them with the QT-Arms.

00:17:57.850 --> 00:17:58.970
Take this time to get away.

00:17:58.970 --> 00:18:00.710
I have set up the escape route.

00:18:00.710 --> 00:18:02.960
H-Hey! Where are you going? Kannagi!

00:18:05.980 --> 00:18:09.720
Why are only these kind of people around me?

00:18:09.720 --> 00:18:12.270
I'm the type to be praised.

00:18:12.270 --> 00:18:16.180
That's why you all should worship me. Worship me till you die.

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:18.680
There is a reaction from the Golden Gun.

00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:20.460
Akiha is nearby.

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:22.400
Akiha is in danger.

00:18:22.400 --> 00:18:23.430
What?!

00:18:26.200 --> 00:18:26.860
I don't care!

00:18:30.580 --> 00:18:31.240
Behind!

00:18:31.690 --> 00:18:33.130
The main event starts now.

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:34.240
Our speciality is

00:18:34.240 --> 00:18:36.290
a complementary combination.

00:18:36.290 --> 00:18:38.090
Let's go, Bou.

00:18:38.090 --> 00:18:39.620
Yes, Min-chan.

00:18:39.620 --> 00:18:41.000
Materialize.

00:18:42.740 --> 00:18:44.370
Bougarion.

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:50.880
Min-Tiger.

00:18:53.860 --> 00:18:54.960
They separated.

00:18:54.960 --> 00:18:56.430
Oh... Separately.

00:19:02.640 --> 00:19:04.190
Bou, go after that space ship.

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:05.770
Okay, Min-chan.

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:07.900
Wait!

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:10.960
Itsuki-chan!

00:19:10.960 --> 00:19:12.780
I won't allow you to escape.

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:15.780
She's coming... what should I do?

00:19:16.120 --> 00:19:18.120
Prepare yourself.

00:19:19.370 --> 00:19:21.870
T-There're two Bougarions?!

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:36.010
Leopard...

00:19:36.010 --> 00:19:38.970
W-What's with this over-sized chandelier?

00:19:47.330 --> 00:19:49.340
That's my QT-Arms.

00:19:49.340 --> 00:19:50.190
Why?

00:19:50.190 --> 00:19:52.520
Oops... My hand slipped.

00:19:52.520 --> 00:19:55.000
I accidentally sent out the QT-Arms.

00:20:01.370 --> 00:20:03.790
My foot slipped and accidentally fell into it.

00:20:12.900 --> 00:20:13.910
Akiha.

00:20:16.080 --> 00:20:17.610
Itsuki-chan, are you all right?

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:18.600
Shishidou-san.

00:20:23.870 --> 00:20:25.730
Are you all right, Shishidou-san?!

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:29.830
Shishidou-san?

00:20:30.210 --> 00:20:32.650
We are going to get them back, right?

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:34.110
What?

00:20:35.770 --> 00:20:36.630
Yeah...

00:20:36.940 --> 00:20:41.120
Ah... It's so boring, maybe I'll move some of my mirrors.

00:20:41.120 --> 00:20:43.370
You're going to be hurting in the morning if you hit one!

00:20:43.790 --> 00:20:46.140
That's true... It looks like it's going to hurt a lot.

00:20:52.000 --> 00:20:52.960
W-What...

00:20:52.960 --> 00:20:55.550
are you trying to do?!

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:02.740
That's way too far!

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:08.900
Shishidou-san, that was well done.

00:21:09.940 --> 00:21:10.650
We did it!

00:21:10.650 --> 00:21:12.670
You stupid withered leaf!

00:21:12.670 --> 00:21:15.130
You used too much force.

00:21:15.130 --> 00:21:17.590
Don't you know how to hold back?

00:21:17.590 --> 00:21:18.560
Idiot! Let me go!

00:21:18.560 --> 00:21:22.120
Honoka-chan, Itsuki-chan says that she wants to meet Leopard.

00:21:22.120 --> 00:21:23.490
That...

00:21:23.490 --> 00:21:26.370
Please. Believe in Itsuki-chan.

00:21:26.780 --> 00:21:30.880
If she helps us acquire the next part on the Moon, then I'll let her meet him.

00:21:30.880 --> 00:21:32.930
Being accomplices to theft...

00:21:32.930 --> 00:21:34.520
There's no other choice.

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:35.440
Ul.

00:21:35.440 --> 00:21:38.530
Do whatever we need to. We have enough reason to.

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:41.320
Understood, Honoka-san.

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:42.400
All right.

00:21:42.400 --> 00:21:46.240
Then we will have to apply for leave from school.

00:21:47.030 --> 00:21:49.870
Akiha has submitted an application for absence of leave.

00:21:49.870 --> 00:21:54.690
It says that the older sister has fallen ill, and in order to look after her, she will be applying for two days leave.

00:21:55.570 --> 00:21:58.050
Don't let me get sick randomly.

00:22:00.730 --> 00:22:01.530
Is there anything else?

00:22:01.530 --> 00:22:05.540
It's late. The contact from Takane.

00:22:15.160 --> 00:22:16.790
That's our target base.

00:22:16.790 --> 00:22:20.770
Isn't this the St. Artemis Correctional Center, bratty?

00:22:20.770 --> 00:22:22.410
What is that?

00:22:22.410 --> 00:22:25.630
It's a facility that does not exist in any database.

00:22:26.210 --> 00:22:29.980
There are reports that state that it is a criminal hideout.

00:22:38.510 --> 00:22:44.210
My heart is on a trip,

00:22:43.970 --> 00:22:50.160
Blooming at the number of stars that no one has seen

00:22:50.250 --> 00:22:55.940
With unstoppable curiosity,

00:22:55.660 --> 00:22:58.460
I want to go with you,

00:22:57.860 --> 00:23:01.550
in a shuttle flying through the past and future

00:23:01.170 --> 00:23:06.690
Advancing forward, don't stop us.

00:23:06.320 --> 00:23:12.900
Trying to change tomorrow is fine, right?

00:23:12.850 --> 00:23:18.430
Go on, with the excited feeling

00:23:18.000 --> 00:23:24.890
you found from the answer found when you were lost.

00:23:24.570 --> 00:23:30.830
Jump from Earth! Encounters are the galaxies' crossroads

00:23:30.430 --> 00:23:36.700
Isn't coincidence's prank pleasant?

00:23:36.330 --> 00:23:39.500
Suddenly jumping boundlessly

00:23:39.230 --> 00:23:42.390
Friends of space

00:23:42.140 --> 00:23:48.110
Journeys do become a habit, don't they?

00:23:47.980 --> 00:23:53.740
Journeys and girls are the same...

00:23:53.710 --> 00:23:55.770
Ya know!

00:24:00.060 --> 00:24:15.070
White Black Belt

00:24:01.090 --> 00:24:03.430
I'm playing Shiritori with Leopard.

00:24:03.430 --> 00:24:06.140
That's boring. Totally boring.

00:24:06.140 --> 00:24:08.130
You ended with "N."

00:24:08.130 --> 00:24:09.080
You lost?

00:24:12.400 --> 00:24:15.070
Did I just waste my time?
